  <p id="c-songshu-062-zhangfu-shizhong-word:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">司徒故左長史<persName id="c-songshu-062-zhangfu-shizhong-word:p001:m0006" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">張敷</persName>，貞心簡立，幼樹風規。居哀毀滅，孝道淳至，宜在追甄，於以報美。可追贈侍中。</p>
